\begin_layout Standard
Finally, in order to get 
\begin_inset Formula $p\left(y\right)$
\end_inset

 in the interval 
\begin_inset Formula $y\in\left]-\infty,+\infty\right[$
\end_inset

, the solution 
\begin_inset Formula $y$
\end_inset

 obtained with (
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:expgenerator"

\end_inset

) must be multiplied by the random number 
\begin_inset Formula $s=sign(2x_{s}-1)$
\end_inset

, where 
\begin_inset Formula $x_{s}$
\end_inset

 is another uniform random number itself in the interval 
\begin_inset Formula $x_{s}\in\left]0,1\right[$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

